In the latest version of jbovlaste, for-print dictionary production is
working.  It doesn't look amazingly great, but it's working.

*PLEASE* don't all rush out and print the English dictionary.  It beats
my machine to hell.  The Esperanto dictionary has enough to demonstrate
the features.

Also, note that words that haven't been voted on, in either direction,
will *not* show up in the dictionaries.

Note that this marks the completion of *ALL* major features.  Everything
from here on in is gravy.

